<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. Secretary of War Pete Hegseth arrived in Bogotá, delivered a C-130 and met with President De la Espriella to deepen security cooperation, while also announcing a US-Venezuela military partnership in Caracas. Colombia rejected a U.S. proposal for joint anti-drug strikes and De la Espriella ordered a tenth bombing against a narcoterrorist target in Valle del Cauca. In Kyiv, a 19‑year-old woman was detained for poisoning a former Colombian soldier of the Ukrainian Armed Forces for $1,000. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPLUdEX2NMaFBqSWQ4RlNLd2hUcEJrQmEyODV4TXlnTk1IR3hUeUxfRnZ5UDJOVFNZX1llSjRiT1RYTXNhc2tycjhMUUh2ejBscXIzMXVlOU44a21oWVlDb1AyU2RLNG12d0pGLUZpaW5PTlVEWkJEckxGVDYtOUtLWG4yeUk1VHgwTkVYNGdYenVrZXBhZjF4UURyaWExU2JYaDk5dU5XaGpHTEh1XzNWOVI5YnEtUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPVVBUZUFXdnVydHBwSnFPQzZMWjhnaFI3QlowQ0FCcEgyQzNRNnlOU3NMcmdLSklhRXpmMlB6dUZrX1FZQ2pnVFAxSzhTdXd4WkEyX1VlZkpXLVhQLWhGMzZuclM5MHItYmNTdE5DT20zZk5idEZob1FCdXF5akZXano4VWFfZktYNElBc0w4T0RmUEs4ejNHQjJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxONEpaamhWeEFDdmRYMXRjR2NEd3Z4eGhIYUZsUXF1cEVETjlwTG9WeTBEWUp3R2NRbU9wNWR3UHBaY3VZYXF5TzlXMXRIWWw2SXkzTC1QbXVJT2NYYmdZc09FU3RVN20yRnZkQm54bWtWUXN4VXl0OHlIOTJISXF2NFZhOHY3S2JTSDh3OU9lR2FtcDhXR3QydFI3ZGItMy1DNW5hQklGY2xEZVR2cUhJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin America Reports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQYjI1bTlnOWN6UXRBaFB3TUpjRFUyQ09zNEIxTU9nYnVwcjNEUWdxRFd5aTlLVkN2cEJFajd2alFHcVRVcERwWkgxWjg2MnJaeG9VNTJHLVFWNDdfTlRDVzhsUHl1RkJqWFV5UFN0RGd1UGVrbUhKbFpQazlpQnYtZEVYcEh2UU5UVTYtQjYxQjFfOW5fQ3prODlta3BodE